  "body": "`filter_events_for_client` is time-consuming and expensive.\r\n\r\nFrom this `/messages` request ([full trace](https://gist.github.com/MadLittleMods/c3ace249ce2aec77cb78d19a4f85a776)), it takes 7.83s for 500 events and is one of the biggest time saves left after other `/messages` optimizations we've already made. Most of time is just spent in the database getting the state out.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1201\" alt=\"/message trace in Jaeger show how slow `filter_events_for_client` is\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/558581/194672746-34a8fd74-e6fe-4108-bf22-cb69a755c5af.png\">\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nRelated to `filter_events_for_server` being expensive, https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/3526\r\n\r\n\r\n",
